<%#
  Sportart identifier: a monochrome monogram chip (the Sportart's initial in
  the display serif). Distinguishes sports typographically rather than by
  colour or a generic outline icon, so it stays clear of the status colour
  system and reads as one calm accent.

  Locals:
    sportart: the Sportart name (string)
%>
<span class="sport-chip" title="<%= sportart %>" aria-hidden="true"><%= sportart.to_s.first&.upcase %></span>
